an3.135:1.3 | S: They give what is hard to give, they do what is hard to do, and they endure what is hard to endure. | T: He/she gives what is hard to give, does what is hard to do, endures what is hard to endure.
an3.135:1.4 | S: You should associate with a friend who has these three factors.” | T: A friend endowed with three factors is worth associating with.”
